Gentoo overlay staging area for disgrace
======================================

This directory is a ready-to-use overlay root holding the
media-sound/disgrace ebuild. To use it with emerge:

1. Push the release tag the ebuild points at (SRC_URI), e.g.:

       git tag v0.1.0
       git push public v0.1.0

   The tag must exist on GitHub before the distfile can be fetched.

2. Register the overlay (as root), e.g. via a repos.conf entry:

       mkdir -p /etc/portage/repos.conf
       printf '[disgrace]\nlocation = /path/to/dist/gentoo\n' \
           > /etc/portage/repos.conf/disgrace.conf

3. Generate the Manifest and install:

       ebuild media-sound/disgrace/disgrace-0.1.0.ebuild manifest
       emerge -av media-sound/disgrace

Notes:

- New ebuilds carry testing keywords (~amd64); stabilize only after
  the package is verified on Gentoo.
- Festival and Piper TTS support auto-detects at configure time and
  stays off unless the corresponding libraries are installed.
